  "description": "AutoMapperLite is a lightweight object-to-object mapper for .NET — a small, dependency-minimal alternative to AutoMapper for mapping DTOs and entities. Each source/destination type pair is compiled into a cached delegate via System.Linq.Expressions on first use, rather than interpreted via reflection on every call. Targets net6.0 through net10.0. Features fluent CreateMap/ForMember/ForPath profiles for custom and nested member mapping, mapping to List<T>, arrays, and common collection interfaces (IList<T>, ICollection<T>, IReadOnlyList<T>, IEnumerable<T>), thread-safe configuration, and singleton-friendly dependency injection via AddAutoMapperLite. Built for projects that want a simple, dependency-minimal mapper without a large footprint; see the published benchmarks for exactly how it compares to AutoMapper and Mapster. Official site: https://automapperlite.atkhssn.info",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
  "id": "AutoMapperLite",
